        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "ca2a9dd5-6c64-5103-b692-f048af816626",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thomas Tull, Todd Phillips, Daniel Goldberg, Jon Lucas, Scott Moore\n- Companies: Legendary Entertainment, Warner Bros., Universal Studios\n- Products: The Hangover\n- Characters: Phil Wenneck, Stu Price, Alan Garner, Doug Billings\n- Places: Las Vegas\n\nFacts:\n- Thomas Tull was born in 1970 and is an American businessman and film producer.\n- Legendary Entertainment was founded by Thomas Tull in 2000.\n- In 2005, Legendary Entertainment concluded an agreement to co-produce and co-finance films with Warner Bros.\n- The Hangover is a 2009 American comedy film directed by Todd Phillips, co-produced with Daniel Goldberg, and written by Jon Lucas and Scott Moore.\n- The Hangover follows Phil Wenneck, Stu Price, Alan Garner, and Doug Billings as they travel to Las Vegas for a bachelor party celebrating Doug Billings's impending marriage.\n- In 2014, Legendary Entertainment began a similar co-production and co-financing arrangement with Universal Studios.",
